    ('july-11', 'july-11-draft-order-1', 8, 'Build It', 'order', '{"id":"july-11-draft-order-1","format":"order","type":"order","section":"Build It","topic":"culture","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the culture meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “人は話す時に近くに立つことがあります。”.","hintJa":"「人は話す時に近くに立つことがあります。」を表す英文と、cultureの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Correct order: “People sometimes stand close when they talk.”. Build the sentence around the culture pattern.","explanationJa":"正しい語順は「People sometimes stand close when they talk.」です。cultureの形を中心に文を組み立てます。","prompt":"Put the words in order: 人は話す時に近くに立つことがあります。","promptJa":"語順を並べましょう：人は話す時に近くに立つことがあります。","words":["People","sometimes","stand","close","when","they","talk"],"correctWords":["People","sometimes","stand","close","when","they","talk"]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
