    ('july-11', 'july-11-draft-matching', 10, 'Build It', 'matching', '{"id":"july-11-draft-matching","format":"matching","type":"matching","section":"Build It","topic":"connected","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the connected meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “携帯はWi-Fiにつながっています。”.","hintJa":"「携帯はWi-Fiにつながっています。」を表す英文と、connectedの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Each English phrase has exactly one Japanese meaning. Match the whole message rather than isolated words.","explanationJa":"各英文に対応する日本語は一つです。単語だけではなく、表現全体の意味で組み合わせましょう。","prompt":"Match the English and Japanese.","promptJa":"英語と日本語を組み合わせてください。","pairs":[{"en":"My phone is connected to the Wi-Fi.","jp":"携帯はWi-Fiにつながっています。","cat":"connected"},{"en":"I connected the cable.","jp":"ケーブルを接続しました。","cat":"connect"},{"en":"The program is broadcast live.","jp":"その番組は生放送されます。","cat":"broadcast"},{"en":"We watched the live stream.","jp":"ライブ配信を見ました。","cat":"stream"},{"en":"I went back to my hometown.","jp":"地元に帰りました。","cat":"hometown"},{"en":"I’m staying at my parents’ house.","jp":"実家に泊まっています。","cat":"family"}]}'::jsonb, false, 6),
    ('july-11', 'july-11-draft-sorting', 11, 'Build It', 'sorting', '{"id":"july-11-draft-sorting","format":"sorting","type":"sorting","section":"Build It","topic":"connect","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the connect meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “ケーブルを接続しました。”.","hintJa":"「ケーブルを接続しました。」を表す英文と、connectの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Sort by the purpose of the complete phrase. The available topics are connected, connect, broadcast.","explanationJa":"英文全体の目的で分類します。今回の分類は「connected・connect・broadcast」です。","prompt":"Sort the phrases by topic.","promptJa":"表現をトピック別に分類してください。","categories":["connected","connect","broadcast"],"items":[["My phone is connected to the Wi-Fi.","connected"],["I connected the cable.","connect"],["The program is broadcast live.","broadcast"]]}'::jsonb, false, 3),
    ('july-11', 'july-11-draft-listen-choice-1', 12, 'Listen', 'listenChoice', '{"id":"july-11-draft-listen-choice-1","format":"listenChoice","type":"listenChoice","section":"Listen","topic":"connected","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the connected meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “携帯はWi-Fiにつながっています。”.","hintJa":"「携帯はWi-Fiにつながっています。」を表す英文と、connectedの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"The sentence in the audio is “My phone is connected to the Wi-Fi.”. Listen through to the end before choosing.","explanationJa":"音声の英文は「My phone is connected to the Wi-Fi.」です。最後まで聞いてから選びましょう。","prompt":"Listen and choose the sentence.","promptJa":"音声を聞いて英文を選んでください。","audioText":"My phone is connected to the Wi-Fi.","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"My phone is connected to the Wi-Fi.","jp":"携帯はWi-Fiにつながっています。"},{"id":"b","en":"I connected the cable.","jp":"ケーブルを接続しました。"},{"id":"c","en":"I went back to my hometown.","jp":"地元に帰りました。"},{"id":"d","en":"People sometimes stand close when they talk.","jp":"人は話す時に近くに立つことがあります。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
