    ('july-18', 'july-18-draft-matching', 10, 'Build It', 'matching', '{"id":"july-18-draft-matching","format":"matching","type":"matching","section":"Build It","topic":"supposed to","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the supposed to meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “そのクラスに参加する予定でした。”.","hintJa":"「そのクラスに参加する予定でした。」を表す英文と、supposed toの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Each English phrase has exactly one Japanese meaning. Match the whole message rather than isolated words.","explanationJa":"各英文に対応する日本語は一つです。単語だけではなく、表現全体の意味で組み合わせましょう。","prompt":"Match the English and Japanese.","promptJa":"英語と日本語を組み合わせてください。","pairs":[{"en":"I was supposed to join the class.","jp":"そのクラスに参加する予定でした。","cat":"supposed to"},{"en":"She has a cat.","jp":"彼女は猫を飼っています。","cat":"has"},{"en":"She doesn’t have a cat.","jp":"彼女は猫を飼っていません。","cat":"doesn''t have"},{"en":"She hasn’t eaten yet.","jp":"彼女はまだ食べていません。","cat":"hasn''t"},{"en":"I do like this song.","jp":"この歌は本当に好きです。","cat":"emphasis"},{"en":"The pot was on the stove.","jp":"鍋はコンロにかかっていました。","cat":"stove"}]}'::jsonb, false, 6),
    ('july-18', 'july-18-draft-sorting', 11, 'Build It', 'sorting', '{"id":"july-18-draft-sorting","format":"sorting","type":"sorting","section":"Build It","topic":"has","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the has meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “彼女は猫を飼っています。”.","hintJa":"「彼女は猫を飼っています。」を表す英文と、hasの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Sort by the purpose of the complete phrase. The available topics are supposed to, has, doesn''t have.","explanationJa":"英文全体の目的で分類します。今回の分類は「supposed to・has・doesn''t have」です。","prompt":"Sort the phrases by topic.","promptJa":"表現をトピック別に分類してください。","categories":["supposed to","has","doesn''t have"],"items":[["I was supposed to join the class.","supposed to"],["She has a cat.","has"],["She doesn’t have a cat.","doesn''t have"],["We’re supposed to meet at ten.","supposed to"]]}'::jsonb, false, 4),
