    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-order-2', 9, 'Build It', 'order', '{"id":"july-26-draft-order-2","format":"order","type":"order","section":"Build It","topic":"past perfect","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the past perfect meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “あなたが到着した時にはもう食べていました。”.","hintJa":"「あなたが到着した時にはもう食べていました。」を表す英文と、past perfectの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Correct order: “I had already eaten when you arrived.”. Build the sentence around the past perfect pattern.","explanationJa":"正しい語順は「I had already eaten when you arrived.」です。past perfectの形を中心に文を組み立てます。","prompt":"Put the words in order: あなたが到着した時にはもう食べていました。","promptJa":"語順を並べましょう：あなたが到着した時にはもう食べていました。","words":["I","had","already","eaten","when","you","arrived"],"correctWords":["I","had","already","eaten","when","you","arrived"]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-matching', 10, 'Build It', 'matching', '{"id":"july-26-draft-matching","format":"matching","type":"matching","section":"Build It","topic":"hope","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the hope meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。”.","hintJa":"「来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。」を表す英文と、hopeの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Each English phrase has exactly one Japanese meaning. Match the whole message rather than isolated words.","explanationJa":"各英文に対応する日本語は一つです。単語だけではなく、表現全体の意味で組み合わせましょう。","prompt":"Match the English and Japanese.","promptJa":"英語と日本語を組み合わせてください。","pairs":[{"en":"I hope I can visit Malaysia next year.","jp":"来年マレーシアへ行けるといいな。","cat":"hope"},{"en":"I wish I were in Malaysia now.","jp":"今マレーシアにいたらいいのに。","cat":"wish"},{"en":"I wish I had studied harder.","jp":"もっと勉強しておけばよかった。","cat":"regret"},{"en":"I wish I had been born there.","jp":"そこで生まれていたらよかった。","cat":"past perfect"},{"en":"I have already eaten breakfast.","jp":"もう朝食を食べました。","cat":"present perfect"},{"en":"I haven’t eaten dinner yet.","jp":"まだ夕食を食べていません。","cat":"yet"}]}'::jsonb, false, 6),
    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-sorting', 11, 'Build It', 'sorting', '{"id":"july-26-draft-sorting","format":"sorting","type":"sorting","section":"Build It","topic":"wish","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the wish meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “今マレーシアにいたらいいのに。”.","hintJa":"「今マレーシアにいたらいいのに。」を表す英文と、wishの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"Sort by the purpose of the complete phrase. The available topics are hope, wish, regret.","explanationJa":"英文全体の目的で分類します。今回の分類は「hope・wish・regret」です。","prompt":"Sort the phrases by topic.","promptJa":"表現をトピック別に分類してください。","categories":["hope","wish","regret"],"items":[["I hope I can visit Malaysia next year.","hope"],["I wish I were in Malaysia now.","wish"],["I wish I had studied harder.","regret"]]}'::jsonb, false, 3),
