    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-listen-choice-2', 13, 'Listen', 'listenChoice', '{"id":"july-26-draft-listen-choice-2","format":"listenChoice","type":"listenChoice","section":"Listen","topic":"past perfect","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the past perfect meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “そこで生まれていたらよかった。”.","hintJa":"「そこで生まれていたらよかった。」を表す英文と、past perfectの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"The sentence in the audio is “I wish I had been born there.”. Listen through to the end before choosing.","explanationJa":"音声の英文は「I wish I had been born there.」です。最後まで聞いてから選びましょう。","prompt":"Listen and choose the sentence.","promptJa":"音声を聞いて英文を選んでください。","audioText":"I wish I had been born there.","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"I wish I had been born there.","jp":"そこで生まれていたらよかった。"},{"id":"b","en":"I have already eaten breakfast.","jp":"もう朝食を食べました。"},{"id":"c","en":"I have lived here since 2016.","jp":"2016年からここに住んでいます。"},{"id":"d","en":"I didn’t take a bath last night.","jp":"昨夜はお風呂に入りませんでした。"}],"correct":"a"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
