    ('july-26', 'july-26-draft-dictation-1', 15, 'Listen', 'listenType', '{"id":"july-26-draft-dictation-1","format":"listenType","type":"listenType","section":"Listen","topic":"wish","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the wish meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “今マレーシアにいたらいいのに。”.","hintJa":"「今マレーシアにいたらいいのに。」を表す英文と、wishの形に注目しましょう。","explanation":"The complete sentence is “I wish I were in Malaysia now.”. Check every small word as well as the main vocabulary.","explanationJa":"全文は「I wish I were in Malaysia now.」です。中心の単語だけでなく、短い機能語も確認しましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete sentence you hear.","promptJa":"聞こえた英文を入力してください。","audioText":"I wish I were in Malaysia now.","accepted":["I wish I were in Malaysia now."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
